XHIBIT Model Court localproxy - Python CGI

The proxy preserves the Model Court p3.0 XML contract. Required database columns
include CDU.cduNumber and SITE.welshTitle, with urlMappings; there is no migration
or silent fallback. Software endpoints serve an explicitly configured Python-only
cdu.tar. Legacy .php URLs are Apache aliases, not PHP source files.

Manager is optional, default OFF and not production-verified. Use --with-manager
consistently for packaging, Apache generation and preflight to include it.
Existing form/database/audit semantics remain unchanged.

See migration/README.md and migration/VALIDATION.md for build/test/pilot/rollback
instructions and outstanding gates. Keep pd_cdu alongside this checkout.
No push, deployment, host PHP removal, runtime upgrade or database migration is
performed by the tooling. Account for external PHP consumers before host removal.
